 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** High. Perceptual loss requires forward passes through a deep CNN (VGG-19) for both the rendered and ground truth images [S4]. Computing it every 20 iterations is necessary to alleviate this overhead [S4]. Training takes on average 41.5 hours per scene on one GeForce 1080 Ti [S5].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Moderate to High. Requires storing intermediate feature maps from the VGG network for the backpropagation step [S6].
